{c: Verse 1}
[Bm]Mabbulona vaana villulaa,        [A]Mattilona neeti jallulaa
[Bm]Gundelona prema mullulaa,        [A]daaginavugaa
[Bm]Andamaina aasha theerakaa,        [A]Kaalchuthondhi konte korikaa
[Bm]Prema picchi penchadaanikaa,        [A]champadaanikaa
[Bm]Korukunna preyasive,        [A]Dooramaina urvashive
[Bm]Jaalileni rakshasive,        [A]Gundeloni [D]naakasive
[Bm]Chepakalla roopasive,        [A]Chithramaina thaapasive
[Bm]Cheekatinta naa shashive,        [A]Sarasaku [D]cheli [A]cheli [Bm]raa
Yella [A]vidichi bathakane pilla [Bm]raa,        Nuvve [A]kanabadavaa [Bm]kallaraa
Ninne [A]thalachi thalachilaa [Bm]unnagaa,        Nuvve [A]yedha sadive [Bm]annagaa
Yella [A]vidichi bathakane pilla [Bm]raa,        Nuvve [A]kanabadavaa ka [Bm]llaraa
